+## `pluralize(count, word)`
+
+Writes a count with its word. The word gets an "s" unless the count is exactly one.
+
+```gleam
+wordkit.pluralize(1, "item") // "1 item"
+wordkit.pluralize(0, "item") // "0 items"
+wordkit.pluralize(3, "item") // "3 items"
+```
+
 Run the tests with `gleam test`.
diff --git a/src/wordkit.gleam b/src/wordkit.gleam
